## Medical Disclaimer

MenCare Health Hub is an educational and healthcare-information platform.

The software and its content do not:

* Diagnose diseases
* Prescribe medication
* Replace professional medical advice
* Provide personalized medical treatment
* Provide emergency medical treatment
* Provide online medical consultations
* Guarantee the accuracy or completeness of third-party healthcare information

Users should seek appropriate professional medical care for concerning, persistent, worsening, or emergency symptoms.

